# Pine Script v6

- First line is always `//@version=6`.
- Use `indicator()` until the user asks for a strategy or library.
- Prefer `ta.*` builtins over hand-rolled averages and oscillators.
- Name inputs `*Input` (`fastInput`, `lengthInput`).
- One visual idea per `plot` / `plotshape`. Do not hide signals in comments.
- This file cannot be executed locally. The deliverable is copy-paste into TradingView Pine Editor.
